.Dd November 22, 2026
.Dt WORI 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wori
.Nd minimal C++ input and output library
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In wori.hpp
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
library provides lightweight and low-level input and output functions
for C++ programs.
.Sh FUNCTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "wrout()"
.It Fn wrout "value"
Outputs a value to standard output.
.It Fn rin <datatype>
Reads input from standard input.
.El
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Kai